                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "geyser",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1dcbddea-e7f7-35ff-90f9-7d49caa52282",
                                        "entry_id": "5f91af76-e9ea-3686-bc51-ee108b092f82",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A boiling natural spring which throws forth jets of water, mud, etc., at frequent intervals, driven upwards by the expansive power of steam."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d653024-66ec-349b-bfc9-3f61f7955396",
                                        "entry_id": "5f91af76-e9ea-3686-bc51-ee108b092f82",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A momentary vertical jet or fountain of fluid driven upwards by a violent force."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f304c89c-4671-454f-b116-c1de79f781fd",
                                                "sense_id": "4d653024-66ec-349b-bfc9-3f61f7955396",
                                                "text": "Sporting a few war wounds from Japanese destroyer gunfire, The Sullivans had already launched one spread of torpedoes at the Japanese destroyers that were now littering the ocean floor, or, occasionally, making their own retreat, but she still had one left, so a five-torpedo spread was duly sent at near-point-blank range into the listing and burning remains of Yamato, and, shortly thereafter, four large geysers of water were the reward."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86446652-1c10-378f-a370-12dd77892de0",
                                        "entry_id": "5f91af76-e9ea-3686-bc51-ee108b092f82",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instantaneous, and often dangerous, hot water heater."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British",
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cab16de2-bce8-441d-a456-fd7356ea6c7d",
                                                "sense_id": "86446652-1c10-378f-a370-12dd77892de0",
                                                "text": "Where a Geyser or hot-water heater is used it is a good and wise precaution to see that the bath-room, &c., when it is used is well ventilated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d45ac8dc-badf-442e-b51f-910fe68ee12b",
                                                "sense_id": "86446652-1c10-378f-a370-12dd77892de0",
                                                "text": "Water was heated either on the gas stove, or on a wall mounted gas-fired \"geyser\" heater."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7afb1a3a-cfad-44d2-af32-ab6896e86f89",
                                                "sense_id": "86446652-1c10-378f-a370-12dd77892de0",
                                                "text": "It was here I saw a geyser gas water heater in a bathroom for the first time. (I was afraid of it)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51107a87-869e-3542-a4a0-50182db97c91",
                                        "entry_id": "5f91af76-e9ea-3686-bc51-ee108b092f82",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A domestic water boiler."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "South-Africa",
                                            "South-Asia"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "geyser",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8a5166c-4b03-3ba6-b2ca-cb03d31ebeeb",
                                        "entry_id": "71a003a6-518a-3bdb-b3a9-5538637a04e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To (cause to) rush or burst upward like water from a geyser."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df5cc24f-70e1-4a4c-b9ad-733b3cb2954a",
                                                "sense_id": "f8a5166c-4b03-3ba6-b2ca-cb03d31ebeeb",
                                                "text": "Four jets of water geysered upward from the sea. Short and wide. He noted it. Ranging salvo. His division was discovered."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "35cb542d-ba1f-4d83-a03a-afa5e4e0b2c1",
                        "source_entry_id": "a892a867-d846-329a-b182-b5c0f333be54",
                        "source_sense_id": "58a05f33-4b5f-35fe-aaaa-f75ae976c4c0",
                        "source_sense_description": "Namibia: Gerät zur Bereitung (und Speicherung) von warmem bis heißem Wasser",
                        "target_lang_word": "chauffe-eau",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chauffe-eau",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da9b80d7-3589-3814-8eed-362a59569be1",
                                        "entry_id": "e8a3dc25-8919-3585-9ba5-ac5a5a91b9bb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Appareil fournissant l’eau chaude domestique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b9b3645-ef01-4542-937d-cece1f8ffaf3",
                                                "sense_id": "da9b80d7-3589-3814-8eed-362a59569be1",
                                                "text": "Dans le but de fournir l'eau chaude à bon marché dans les maisons du Congo belge, il serait possible d'établir des chauffe-eaux solaires."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc55815e-fd69-4815-9b74-aeaa6011a9d8",
                                                "sense_id": "da9b80d7-3589-3814-8eed-362a59569be1",
                                                "text": "Pour les chauffe-eau solaires monobloc, des avis techniques et des certificats de contrôle de qualité (CSTBat) sont délivrés par le Centre Scientifique et Technique du Bâtiment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cef139b6-89ca-4d15-81d5-915354a2cd3c",
                                                "sense_id": "da9b80d7-3589-3814-8eed-362a59569be1",
                                                "text": "Il était tellement désœuvré que, depuis quelques semaines, il s’était mis à parler à son chauffe-eau. Et le plus inquiétant – il en avait pris conscience l’avant-veille – était qu’il s’attendait maintenant à ce que le chauffe-eau lui réponde. L’appareil produisait il est vrai des bruits de plus en plus variés : gémissements, ronflements, claquements secs, sifflements de tonalité et de volume variés ; on pouvait s’attendre un jour ou l’autre à ce qu’il accède au langage articulé. Il était, en somme, son plus ancien compagnon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "60e32fd6-3d86-4a78-bf3b-74f87d7819e4",
                        "source_entry_id": "a892a867-d846-329a-b182-b5c0f333be54",
                        "source_sense_id": "58a05f33-4b5f-35fe-aaaa-f75ae976c4c0",
